 "method_and_limits": {
  "depth_proxy": "G2/G3 per-game records carry ONLY terminal aggregates (seed, hands, level_end, n_alive_end, hero_net). True depth-at-decision EV attribution is IMPOSSIBLE from existing artifacts. Proxy used: terminal avg surviving stack in BB = 9000 / n_alive_end / bb(level_end), computed on the BASELINE trajectory (fixed recording -> bucket variable exogenous to candidate). Buckets: <=6bb, 6-12bb, 12-25bb, >25bb.",
  "selection_caveat": "terminal depth conflates 'phase where game was decided' with game length; it is a proxy, not per-hand depth.",
  "cheapest_harness_fix": "have the G2/G3 runner append a per-hand record (hand_idx, level, hero_stack_bb, n_alive, hand_net_chips) per game, plus first-divergence hand id under CRN pairing; the ab harness already logs per-decision hero_eff_bb, so the logging plumbing exists. ~4 fields/hand, no extra compute."
 },
